=== A. sum-freeness of valuation classes, range [1,4096] ===
   bare v_2 level sets sum-free: YES (no violation)
   bare v_3 level sets sum-free: NO  e.g. (1, 1, 2)
   bare v_5 level sets sum-free: NO  e.g. (1, 1, 2)
   v_3+leading-digit classes sum-free: YES (no violation)
   v_5+leading-digit classes sum-free: YES (no violation)
   (hand proof: L_v sum-free <=> u1+u2 = 0 mod p for ALL units <=> |units|=1 <=> p=2;
    refined classes: u+u = 2u != u mod p whenever u != 0 — sum-free for every p)

